Bard wrote:
> Found some boots of speed early in my current game. Since this is
> something I'll likely wear the whole game, I want to enchant/foo-proof
> them, but which to do first? Is the benefit of fooproofing worth the
> extra AC point trade off in early game? how about for artifact weapons
> (mjolnir). 
> 
> 10lvl human valk AC:-9 fwiw.
> 
> Thoughts?

Speed boots are only worth one point of AC, so I'd go for enchantment 
first. If they do get throughly bunrt and rotted, the +1 cancels out the 
damage (since the base AC can't go below 0), and until they get damaged 
you're ahead. Of course if they're already damaged, then it really 
doesn't matter, and I suppose I'd go for fireproofing just for the sake 
of my character's image.

